    "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
    "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Key benefits</span></span></p>\n<p><b>Fixation philosophy</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix the tuberosities in order to support the head</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>Nail design</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Tuberosity-based screw pattern lags fragments perpendicular to the pull of the muscles</li>\n<li>Screw pattern supports periphery of humeral head fragment and avoids the articular surface</li>\n<li>Straight nail design avoids rotator cuff insertion</li>\n</ul>\n",
    "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Dec 14 2022 02:46:55 GMT+0000",
    "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
